### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### health.http — Health Contract (ADR-040)
### Validates the gateway boot; a backend's actuator is not reachable through the edge.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health Check — the edge's own liveness
# @name healthCheck
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

?? status == 200
?? body status == UP

###

### Health Check — a backend's actuator is not forwarded
# @name actuatorNotForwarded
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

?? status == 404
